it IntoV {\n    | ^^^^^^^^^^^\nhelp: there is a method `into` with a similar name\n    |\n315 -             let v2 = c2v { c: 0.0, s: 0.0 }.into_v();\n315 +             let v2 = c2v { c: 0.0, s: 0.0 }.into();\n    |\n\nSome errors have detailed explanations: E0560, E0599.\nFor more information about an error, try `rustc --explain E0560`.\nerror: could not compile `translation` (test \"phase_b_primitives\") due to 3 previous errors","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false}}
